528", "formattedPrice": "￦4,400", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 1, "trackContentRating": "4+", "sellerUrl": "https://jdictionary-mobile.com", "artistId": 508965227, "artistName": "JDMI Kft.", "genres": ["참고", "여행"], "price": 4400.0, "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2025-02-18T18:11:36Z", "bundleId": "com.jdictionarymobile.wfb", "trackId": 310064645, "trackName": "World Factbook & Atlas", "genreIds": ["6006", "6003"], "primaryGenreName": "Reference", "primaryGenreId": 6006, "sellerName": "JDMI Kft.", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "releaseNotes": "Bug fixes, content update, and performance improvements.", "version": "9.8", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "The World Factbook & Atlas is an invaluable resource for those seeking accurate and up-to-date information on the nations of the world. With details on over 250 countries and territories, this app offers concise, well-organized profiles covering topics such as natural resources, industries, GDP, religion, ethnic groups, legal systems, and much more.\n\nIn addition to country profiles, The World Factbook & Atlas includes fascinating chapters on our changing planet, oceans, and areas of the world whose status has not yet been resolved, such as the West Bank and the Spratly Islands.\n\nKey data is grouped under the headings of introduction/background, geography, people, government, economy, environment, energy, space, communications, transportation, military, and transnational issues. The World Factbook & Atlas is a must-have app for anyone with curiosity or concern about the rapidly changing world we live in.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\nUp-to-date Information: The World Factbook & Atlas database is regularly updated, providing the latest and most accurate information available. Best of all, updates are free of charge.\n\nComprehensive Coverage: In addition to detailed country profiles, The World Factbook & Atlas also features interesting chapters on our changing planet, oceans, and areas of the world whose status has not yet been resolved. This comprehensive coverage ensures that you have access to a wealth of information at your fingertips.\n\nOffline World Atlas: With a built-in high-resolution offline world atlas, you can access the app's information anytime, anywhere, without needing an internet connection. This makes it an ideal resource for those on-the-go or traveling to areas with limited connectivity.\n\nCountry Comparison Function: The app's country comparison function allows users to quickly and easily view how countries rank in different categories, providing a valuable resource for those looking to compare nations side-by-side.\n\nWidely Used and Trusted: The World Factbook & Atlas database is widely accepted and used by many government agencies, businessmen, students, and others around the world, with hundreds of thousands of users relying on it for their information needs.\n\nUser-Friendly Interface: The app's fast look-ups, snappy user interface, and smooth-scrolling screens make it easy and enjoyable to use, while the editable history/bookmarks function ensures that you can keep track of the information you need.\n\nPrivacy and Security: The World Factbook & Atlas app is designed to protect your privacy and security. The app does not collect any user data, so you can use it with confidence, knowing that your information is safe. Additionally, the app is offline, so your searches remain safe and secure on your device.", "minimumOsVersion": "13.0", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "trackCensoredName": "World Factbook & Atlas", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/world-factbook-atlas/id310064645?uo=4", "averageUserRating": 5, "releaseDate": "2009-04-02T13:35:54Z", "userRatingCount": 1}]}